d value is not ",[295,361,313],{},", the checkbox shows unchecked. In the example, changing only ",[295,364,313],{}," makes the existing value no longer match, so it shows unchecked.",[357,367,368,369,371,372,348],{},"A native form submission sends ",[295,370,313],{}," instead of the browser's default ",[295,373,374],{},"on",[305,376,378],{"id":377},"label","Label",[292,380,381,383,384,387,388,348],{},[295,382,377],{}," defaults to \"Enable\" (\"啟用\" in Traditional Chinese), switching with the locale, and can be overridden with the ",[295,385,386],{},"checkbox.label"," text; see ",[344,389,47],{"href":390},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages",[350,392],{"name":393},"checkbox-label",[292,395,396,397,400],{},"The label shows on one line and is truncated when wider than its container. A tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[344,398,217],{"href":399},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press that shows the tooltip does not change the checked state.",[305,402,404],{"id":403},"description","Description",[292,406,407,409],{},[295,408,403],{}," shows below the label. Without a description, the height matches an input of the same size; with one, the checkbox grows and the description wraps, while the first line still lines up with fields next to it that have no description.",[350,411],{"name":412},"checkbox-description",[305,414,416],{"id":415},"color-and-icon","Color and icon",[292,418,419,420,338,423,426,427,348],{},"Uses the ",[295,421,422],{},"color",[295,424,425],{},"icon"," (the checked icon) of ",[295,428,429],{},"UCheckbox",[350,431],{"name":432},"checkbox-color",[305,434,436],{"id":435},"size-and-states","Size and states",[292,438,439,440,443],{},"The frame height matches an input of the same size. While loading, a spinner of the same size replaces the checkbox and it is disabled. See ",[344,441,102],{"href":442},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[350,445],{"name":446},"checkbox-states",[300,448,450],{"id":449},"examples","Examples",[305,452,454],{"id":453},"next-to-an-input","Next to an input",[292,456,457,458,461,462,465],{},"Inside a flex container, the wrapper shrinks with the available space and truncates the label. To show the full label, set ",[295,459,460],{},"ui.wrapper"," to ",[295,463,464],{},"shrink-0","; a label wider than the container is still truncated with a tooltip.",[350,467],{"name":468},"checkbox-inline",[305,470,472],{"id":471},"input-next-to-the-label","Input next to the label",[292,474,475,476,479,480,483,484,487,488,491,492,496],{},"Put an input next to the label with ",[295,477,478],{},"#append",". When the input is focused, call ",[295,481,482],{},"check()"," from the slot props to check the box too, and use ",[295,485,486],{},"labelId"," as the input's ",[295,489,490],{},"aria-labelledby",". Clicking non-interactive parts of the appended content does not change the checked state; see ",[344,493,495],{"href":494},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fcheckbox-group#item-append-content","Item append content"," for details.",[350,498],{"name":499},"checkbox-append",[305,501,503],{"id":502},"must-be-checked","Must be checked",[292,505,506,507,510,511,513,514,517],{},"For fields that must be checked, such as agreeing to terms, use ",[295,508,509],{},"v.check"," to check that the bound value equals ",[295,512,313],{}," (not ",[295,515,516],{},"v.literal",", which would narrow the UForm state type).",[350,519],{"name":520},"checkbox-validation",[300,522,524],{"id":523},"props","Props",[526,527],"component-props",{"name":528},"ShuoCheckbox",[292,530,531,532,535,536,539,540,539,543,539,546,539,549,338,552,555,556,558,559,561],{},"See ",[344,533,102],{"href":534},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#shared-props"," for the behavior of ",[295,537,538],{},"size",", ",[295,541,542],{},"disabled",[295,544,545],{},"loading",[295,547,548],{},"skeleton",[295,550,551],{},"id",[295,553,554],{},"name",". The default of ",[295,557,377],{}," can be overridden with the ",[295,560,386],{}," text.",[292,563,564,565,568,569,338,572,575,576,580],{},"Nuxt UI's ",[295,566,567],{},"variant"," (card), ",[295,570,571],{},"indicator",[295,573,574],{},"highlight"," are not supported, so that a frame does not make the option taller and break the height alignment with inputs; see ",[344,577,579],{"href":578},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#built-on-nuxt-ui","Built on Nuxt UI"," for why.",[300,582,584],{"id":583},"slots","Slots",[586,587,588,602],"table",{},[589,590,591],"thead",{},[592,593,594,598,600],"tr",{},[595,596,597],"th",{},"Slot",[595,599,524],{},[595,601,404],{},[603,604,605],"tbody",{},[592,606,607,613,624],{},[608,609,610],"td",{},[295,611,612],{},"append",[608,614,615,539,618,539,620,539,622],{},[295,616,617],{},"checked",[295,619,542],{},[295,621,486],{},[295,623,482],{},[608,625,626,627],{},"Content next to the label; see ",[344,628,495],{"href":494},[300,630,632],{"id":631},"styling","Styling",[292,634,635,638,639,641,642,649,650,653],{},[295,636,637],{},"ui"," accepts every slot of Nuxt UI ",[295,640,429],{},", merged as described in ",[344,643,645,646,648],{"href":644},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Ftheming#per-component-ui-prop","Per-component ",[295,647,637],{}," prop",", plus ",[295,651,652],{},"wrapper",":",[586,655,656,668],{},[589,657,658],{},[592,659,660,662,665],{},[595,661,597],{},[595,663,664],{},"Part",[595,666,667],{},"Built-in styles",[603,669,670,684,700,714],{},[592,671,672,676,679],{},[608,673,674],{},[295,675,652],{},[608,677,678],{},"Outer wrapper that measures truncation, holds the tooltip and positions the loading icon",[608,680,681],{},[295,682,683],{},"relative inline-flex w-fit max-w-full min-w-0 align-top",[592,685,686,691,694],{},[608,687,688],{},[295,689,690],{},"root",[608,692,693],{},"Checkbox frame (Nuxt UI)",[608,695,696,699],{},[295,697,698],{},"w-fit max-w-full min-w-0",", 